title: MandyEntryPointDefault
---
<<if !$helpedMandy>>
    Mandy: Hello, kind sir. As you can see, I'm in a bit of a jam here.
    Mandy: I'm real close to home, just a kilometer due east.
    -> I see that. I could see the smoke as I passed by.
    -> You're Fulmen's associate? 
        <<jump ChangeTheSubjectAbtFulmen>>
    <<if get_dexterity() > 1>>
        -> I can fix this pretty quickly. May I? (Use DEXTERITY to fix the vehicle)
            <<jump IFixOverworldMandyHoverbike>>
    // <<elseif $dirigibleTowingLevel > 2>> 
    //     -> I can tow you with my dirigible back to Fulmen's outpost.
    //     -> My dirigible can tow you and your things. I just need to know what your cargo is.
    //         Mandy: Just forget it, I'm fine for now.
    //         <<jump End02>>
    <<endif>>
    -> I can't help you just now. (Dexterity Skill too Low, and Airship payload at maximum) Is there someone I can contact? Your employer?
    Mandy: My employer, yes... Fulmen, that bastard. Oh, he knows I'm stranded here. He's too 'busy'. Says I need to figure my own shit out.
    -> Well, ok, you don't seem to be in immediate distress. I'll be back if I find a way to help you.
<<else>>
    Mandy: Thanks again, friend.
<<endif>>
===

title: ChangeTheSubjectAbtFulmen
---
Mandy: By all means.
===

title: IFixOverworldMandyHoverbike
---
Mandy: Much obliged, stranger. Here is something for your trouble.
<<give_player_money DialogueCommands 400.0>>
<<set $helpedMandy = true>>
===